會，男女雜坐，行酒稽留，六博投壺，相引為曹，握手無罰，目眙不禁，前有墮珥，后有遺簪，髡竊樂此，飲可八斗而醉二參。日暮酒闌，合尊促坐，男女同席，履舄交錯，杯盤狼藉，堂上燭滅，主人留髡而送客，羅襦襟解，微聞薌澤，當此之時，髡心最歡，能飲一石。故曰酒極則亂，樂極則悲；萬事盡然，言不可極，極之而衰。」以諷諫焉。齊王曰：「善。」乃罷長夜之飲，以髡為諸侯主客。宗室置酒，髡嘗在側。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji126-003:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p004","start":361,"end":365,"surface":"諸侯主客","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m004-0011","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p004","quote":"威王大說，置酒後宮，召髡賜之酒。問曰：「先生能飲幾何而醉？」對曰：「臣飲一斗亦醉，一石亦醉。」威王曰：「先生飲一斗而醉，惡能飲一石哉！其說可得聞乎？」髡曰：「賜酒大王之前，執法在傍，御史在後，髡恐懼俯伏而飲，不過一斗徑醉矣。若親有嚴客，髡帣韝鞠跽，待酒於前，時賜餘瀝，奉觴上壽，數起，飲不過二斗徑醉矣。若朋友交遊，久不相見，卒然相睹，歡然道故，私情相語，飲可五六斗徑醉矣。若乃州閭之會，男女雜坐，行酒稽留，六博投壺，相引為曹，握手無罰，目眙不禁，前有墮珥，后有遺簪，髡竊樂此，飲可八斗而醉二參。日暮酒闌，合尊促坐，男女同席，履舄交錯，杯盤狼藉，堂上燭滅，主人留髡而送客，羅襦襟解，微聞薌澤，當此之時，髡心最歡，能飲一石。故曰酒極則亂，樂極則悲；萬事盡然，言不可極，極之而衰。」以諷諫焉。齊王曰：「善。」乃罷長夜之飲，以髡為諸侯主客。宗室置酒，髡嘗在側。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示封拜與文獻用稱分開；未知授任年及終點保持未知，不以死亡自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji126-001","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"齊","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p002","quote":"淳于髡者，齊之贅婿也。長不滿七尺，滑稽多辯，數使諸侯，未嘗屈辱。齊威王之時喜隱，好為淫樂長夜之飲，沈湎不治，委政卿大夫。百官荒亂，諸侯并侵，國且危亡，在於旦暮，左右莫敢諫。淳于髡說之以隱曰：「國中有大鳥，止王之庭，三年不蜚又不鳴，不知此鳥何也？」王曰：「此鳥不飛則已，一飛沖天；不鳴則已，一鳴驚人。」於是乃朝諸縣令長七十二人，賞一人，誅一人，奮兵而出。諸侯振驚，皆還齊侵地。威行三十六年。語在田完世家中。"}],"source_term":"齊之贅婿","interpretation_note":"傳首地域描述按原詞保留，不推出生地、岳家姓名或現代轄區；歸漢作遷入政權範圍。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p002","text":"淳于髡者，齊之贅婿也。長不滿七尺，滑稽多辯，數使諸侯，未嘗屈辱。齊威王之時喜隱，好為淫樂長夜之飲，沈湎不治，委政卿大夫。百官荒亂，諸侯并侵，國且危亡，在於旦暮，左右莫敢諫。淳于髡說之以隱曰：「國中有大鳥，止王之庭，三年不蜚又不鳴，不知此鳥何也？」王曰：「此鳥不飛則已，一飛沖天；不鳴則已，一鳴驚人。」於是乃朝諸縣令長七十二人，賞一人，誅一人，奮兵而出。諸侯振驚，皆還齊侵地。威行三十六年。語在田完世家中。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"齊威王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0086","start":86,"end":89,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0103","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0154","start":154,"end":162,"surface":"諸縣令長七十二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m002-0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"田完","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p003","text":"威王八年，楚大發兵加齊。齊王使淳于髡之趙請救兵，齎金百斤，車馬十駟。淳于髡仰天大笑，冠纓索絕。王曰：「先生少之乎？」髡曰：「何敢！」王曰：「笑豈有說乎？」髡曰：「今者臣從東方來，見道傍有禳田者，操一豚蹄，酒一盂，祝曰：『甌窶滿篝，汙邪滿車，五穀蕃熟，穰穰滿家。』臣見其所持者狹而所欲者奢，故笑之。」於是齊威王乃益齎黃金千溢，白璧十雙，車馬百駟。髡辭而行，至趙。趙王與之精兵十萬，革車千乘。楚聞之，夜引兵而去。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0093","start":93,"end":96,"surface":"禳田者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly9_9ul_u6x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"髡","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m003-0180","